  "description": {
    "text": "The third POP Series set, 17 cards Pokémon Organized Play gave out in packs at its leagues and tournaments from April to August 2006.\n\nEvery card in the packs is non-holo, Ho-Oh ex too. Holo copies came later in shop products: Blastoise in the Crystal Trainer Set, a Toys \"R\" Us exclusive (September 2006), Minun and Plusle in EX Dragon Frontiers blisters and Flareon, Jolteon and Vaporeon in Eeveelution blisters (both November 2006), and Ho-Oh ex in the 2007 Spring Collector's Tins."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "The POP Series 3 symbol, and a number out of 17"
  },
